1	77	71	95980	1391.0144927536232	2013-07-01	https://www.example.org/погода/22072?q=музыка
2	89	80	107410	1377.051282051282	2013-07-01	https://www.example.org/погода/89216?q=lemon
3	87	81	118534	1481.675	2013-07-01	https://www.example.org/погода/91296?q=delta
4	67	63	87376	1409.2903225806451	2013-07-01	https://www.example.org/погода/8888?q=river
5	62	55	78444	1400.7857142857142	2013-07-01	https://www.example.org/погода/17328?q=omega
